WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.440
I fell to Mars wrapped in giant airbags and bounced across the ground like a beach ball.

2
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:16.700
When I stopped rolling, I opened my petals and let my small friend Sojourner drive out.

3
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.880
I talked to Earth for almost three months.

4
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:27.040
I bounced onto Mars wrapped in airbags, and opened the door for a rover.
